dateMany and $queryRaw are PrismaService operations (CD-01, CMP-09); $queryRaw locks the resources row with SELECT … FOR UPDATE (ADR-004). Every call inside $transaction(work) uses the same tx. The Web App lifeline is the browser client; SessionGuard and RolesGuard run before the controller on every protected route (ADR-002, ADR-003). No password or token is written to history or logs (BR-19, NFR-04)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="818" width="1080" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>